<%- include('../partials/head') %>

<section class="band-title" aria-label="Current offer">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="band-heading">Get <%= site.name %> Today at Our Best Price of the Season</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="hero-dark hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="container hero-dark-grid">
    <div class="hero-dark-visual">
      <div class="halo" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <img class="hero-bottle" src="/img/mitolyn-bottle.png" alt="<%= site.name %> dietary supplement bottle, 30 capsules" width="241" height="350" fetchpriority="high">
    </div>
    <div class="hero-dark-copy">
      <h1 id="hero-title"><mark>Save up to 50% on <%= site.name %>&trade; Today + Free US Shipping + <%= guaranteeDays %>-Day Money-Back Guarantee</mark></h1>
      <p>Tired of feeling tired? <%= site.name %> is a once-daily, plant-based supplement designed to support healthy mitochondrial function, a healthy metabolism and natural, all-day energy, without stimulants or extreme diets.</p>
      <ul class="hero-checks">
        <li><svg width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg> 6 plant-based ingredients</li>
        <li><svg width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg> 1 easy capsule per day</li>
        <li><svg width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg> Made in a GMP-certified US facility</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="btn btn-yellow btn-lg" href="#pricing">Check Your Best Price <svg class="hand" width="26" height="26" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-hand"/></svg></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<article class="review">
  <div class="container narrow">

    <header class="review-head">
      <h2>Mitolyn Review 2026: Is It Worth It for Your Energy and Metabolism?</h2>
      <p class="byline">Updated <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { month: 'long', year: 'numeric' }) %> &middot; Reading time: 6 minutes</p>
    </header>

    <p class="dropcap">If you have ever stepped on the scale after a week of "doing everything right" and seen the same number staring back, you know how discouraging it feels. You cut back, you skip dessert, you walk after dinner, and still your body seems to hold on to every pound. By mid-afternoon you are running on empty, and by evening you have little left for the people and things you love.</p>
    <p>You are not imagining it, and you are not weak. A growing body of research points to a part of metabolism most diets never talk about: the mitochondria inside your cells. This review walks through what <%= site.name %> is, how it is designed to work, what is inside, and how to decide whether it fits your goals.</p>

    <nav class="toc" aria-label="In this review">
      <p class="toc-title">In this review</p>
      <ol>
        <li><a href="#what-is">What is <%= site.name %>?</a></li>
        <li><a href="#how-it-works">How does it work?</a></li>
        <li><a href="#ingredients">What's inside?</a></li>
        <li><a href="#benefits">Benefits</a></li>
        <li><a href="#pricing">Which package should I choose?</a></li>
        <li><a href="#safe">Is it safe?</a></li>
        <li><a href="#faq">FAQ</a></li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    <h2 id="what-is">What is <%= site.name %>?</h2>
    <p><%= site.name %> is a dietary supplement in capsule form, taken once a day. It combines six botanical ingredients, including berries, an adaptogenic root, a microalgae and cocoa, chosen to support the health of your mitochondria, the tiny "power plants" that turn food into usable energy.</p>
    <p>Instead of relying on caffeine or harsh stimulants to force a temporary boost, the formula takes a gentler approach: help your cells do their job well, so energy and metabolism can work the way they are supposed to.</p>
    <ul class="ticks">
      <% quality.forEach((q) => { %><li><svg width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg> <%= q.label %></li><% }) %>
    </ul>

    <p class="cta-inline"><a class="btn btn-yellow" href="#pricing">Check Your Best Price <svg class="hand" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-hand"/></svg></a></p>

    <h2 id="how-it-works">How does <%= site.name %> work?</h2>
    <figure class="figure">
      <img src="/img/mitochondria.svg" alt="Illustration of a mitochondrion converting nutrients into cellular energy" width="520" height="420" loading="lazy">
      <figcaption>Mitochondria convert the nutrients you eat into ATP, the energy your cells run on.</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <% mechanism.paragraphs.forEach((t) => { %><p><%= t %></p><% }) %>
    <blockquote class="pull">When your cells make energy efficiently, everything else gets easier: getting out of bed, staying active, and making healthy choices.</blockquote>

    <h2 id="ingredients">What are the ingredients in <%= site.name %>?</h2>
    <p>Every capsule contains a blend of six plant-based ingredients. Here is what each one brings to the formula:</p>
    <div class="ing-list">
      <% ingredients.forEach((ing) => { %>
      <div class="ing-item reveal">
        <span class="berry" style="--berry: <%= ing.color %>" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <div>
          <h3><%= ing.name %> <span class="latin">(<%= ing.latin %>)</span></h3>
          <p><%= ing.benefit %></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <% }) %>
    </div>
    <p><a class="link" href="/ingredients">See the full ingredient breakdown &rarr;</a></p>

    <h2 id="benefits"><%= site.name %> benefits</h2>
    <div class="benefit-grid">
      <% benefits.forEach((b) => { %>
      <div class="benefit-box reveal">
        <span class="icon-sq"><svg width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-<%= b.icon %>"/></svg></span>
        <h3><%= b.title %></h3>
        <p><%= b.text %></p>
      </div>
      <% }) %>
    </div>

    <p class="cta-inline"><a class="btn btn-yellow" href="#pricing">Check Your Best Price <svg class="hand" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-hand"/></svg></a></p>

    <h2 id="who">Is <%= site.name %> right for me?</h2>
    <p><%= site.name %> may be a good fit if you:</p>
    <ul class="ticks">
      <li><svg width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg> Feel low on energy even after a full night's sleep</li>
      <li><svg width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg> Find that diet and exercise alone are not giving you the results they used to</li>
      <li><svg width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg> Prefer a plant-based, stimulant-free formula</li>
      <li><svg width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg> Want a simple routine: one capsule, once a day</li>
    </ul>
    <p>It is not a replacement for a balanced diet, regular movement or medical care. Think of it as daily support for the healthy habits you are already building.</p>

    <h2 id="safe">Is <%= site.name %> safe?</h2>
    <p><%= site.name %> is made from plant-based ingredients in a GMP-certified facility in the USA, and it contains no stimulants. Most adults tolerate it well. As with any supplement, speak with your doctor first if you are pregnant or nursing, take prescription medication, or have a medical condition.</p>

    <h2 id="how-to">What's the best way to take <%= site.name %>?</h2>
    <ol class="steps-list">
      <% steps.forEach((s) => { %><li><strong><%= s.title %>.</strong> <%= s.text %></li><% }) %>
    </ol>
  </div>
</article>

<%- include('../partials/pricing') %>

<section class="section guarantee-wrap" aria-labelledby="g-title">
  <div class="container narrow guarantee reveal">
    <img src="/img/guarantee.svg" alt="<%= guaranteeDays %>-day money-back guarantee seal" width="180" height="180" loading="lazy">
    <div>
      <h2 id="g-title">Your order is protected by a <%= guaranteeDays %>-day money-back guarantee</h2>
      <p>Try <%= site.name %> for up to <%= guaranteeDays %> days. If you are not happy for any reason, contact customer support within that window for a refund of the product price. You have nothing to lose except the tired, stuck feeling.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section faq-section" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
  <div class="container narrow">
    <h2 id="faq-title">Frequently asked questions</h2>
    <%- include('../partials/faq') %>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="final-dark" aria-labelledby="final-title">
  <div class="container narrow center">
    <h2 id="final-title">What do I do now?</h2>
    <p>Six months from now you could be in the same place, or you could be giving your body the daily cellular support it may be missing. With free US shipping on multi-bottle packages and a <%= guaranteeDays %>-day guarantee, the only real risk is waiting.</p>
    <a class="btn btn-yellow btn-lg" href="#pricing">Check Your Best Price <svg class="hand" width="26" height="26" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-hand"/></svg></a>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
